{"suttaId":"tha-ap272","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[8534,8551],"vripara":"39"},"segments":{"tha-ap272:0.3":"Taraṇiyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap272:1.1":"“Suvaṇṇavaṇṇo sambuddho, vipassī dakkhiṇāraho;","tha-ap272:1.3":"Nadītīre ṭhito satthā, bhikkhusaṅghapurakkhato.","tha-ap272:2.1":"“Nāvā na vijjate tattha, santāraṇī mahaṇṇave;","tha-ap272:2.3":"Nadiyā abhinikkhamma, tāresiṃ lokanāyakaṃ.","tha-ap272:3.1":"“Ekanavutito kappe, yaṃ tāresiṃ naruttamaṃ;","tha-ap272:3.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, taraṇāya idaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap272:4.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap272:5.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā taraṇiyo thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap272:6.1":"Taraṇiyattherassāpadānaṃ dasamaṃ.","tha-ap272:7.1":"Padumukkhipavaggo sattavīsatimo.","tha-ap272:8.1":"Tassuddānaṃ –","tha-ap272:9.1":"Ukkhipī telacandī ca, dīpado ca biḷālido;","tha-ap272:9.3":"Maccho javo saḷalado, rakkhaso taraṇo dasa;","tha-ap272:9.5":"Gāthāyo cettha saṅkhātā, tālīsaṃ cekameva cāti."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
